Revision history for DBIx-Squirrel

Unreleased

    - connect croaks on failure, and clones an existing database
      handle passed in place of a data source.
    - tap runs stages on a handle for their side effects; Stop ends
      them early.
    - The successor to 1.6.5 begins, in a fresh repository: a rewrite in
      modern Perl, requiring Perl 5.36 or later. 1.x is archived in
      https://github.com/nukopian/DBIx-Squirrel-1.
